WEBVTT

00:12:58.308 --> 00:13:00.992
with my own five-step plan
to divine health

00:13:01.016 --> 00:13:03.126
and magical floating feelings.

00:13:04.023 --> 00:13:10.006
I see that the world is jolted by events
that are wonderful and terrible,

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:12.380
gorgeous and tragic.

00:13:13.191 --> 00:13:15.475
I can't reconcile the contradiction,

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:19.752
except that I am beginning to believe
that these opposites

00:13:19.776 --> 00:13:22.239
do not cancel each other out.

00:13:23.047 --> 00:13:25.496
Life is so beautiful,

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:27.520
and life is so hard.